Not to mention we owe him payback for
the truck that almost hit us earlier.

114
00:08:54,333 --> 00:08:55,163
Damn it.

115
00:08:55,353 --> 00:08:56,593
For a piece of shit.

116
00:08:56,753 --> 00:08:58,753
That car can really get up and go.

117
00:09:11,633 --> 00:09:12,515
That's strange.

118
