I am not a fool.

149
00:10:48,593 --> 00:10:50,010
Ah, I get it.

150
00:10:50,093 --> 00:10:53,370
You used the car's winch
instead of just brute strength.

151
00:10:53,453 --> 00:10:54,993
Not bad, Kakyoin.

152
00:10:55,193 --> 00:10:56,610
