153
00:10:56,693 --> 00:10:57,793
You like sumo?

154
00:11:00,273 --> 00:11:02,920
Especially deadlocks at
the edge of the ring.

155
00:11:04,413 --> 00:11:06,393
It's exciting, isn't it?

156
00:11:19,493 --> 00:11:22,093
Yeah, I'm a fan of sumo.

157
00:11:22,393 --> 00:11:25,913
But in sumo, it's against the
rules to punch your opponent.

158
00:11:41,793 --> 00:11:44,513
Nothing here suggests
to use the stand attack.

159
00:11:44,773 --> 00:11:48,650
