186
00:13:23,773 --> 00:13:25,293
Now what is it doing?

187
00:13:29,093 --> 00:13:30,613
It's like it's alive!

188
00:13:37,733 --> 00:13:39,813
It's heading straight for us!

189
00:13:43,913 --> 00:13:46,913
If it's a duel you want,
I'm happy to oblige.

190
00:13:47,033 --> 00:13:48,209
Don't do it, Jotaro!

191
00:13:48,413 --> 00:13:49,531
Don't fight it yet!

192
00:13:49,633 --> 00:13:52,221
Not until we know what
that Stan's power is!

193
00:13:56,533 --> 00:13:57,363
Jotaro!

194
00:13:58,373 --> 00:13:59,203
Impossible.

195
00:13:59,286 --> 00:14:00,116
I couldn't see it.

196
00:14:00,353 --> 00:14:03,882
What the hell did he shoot at
me, and how the hell did he...

197
