What the hell is going on here?

208
00:14:34,613 --> 00:14:36,025
Jotaro, are you alright?

209
00:14:36,373 --> 00:14:38,313
Don't worry about me, old man.

210
00:14:40,193 --> 00:14:44,070
I don't know what the hell he's hurling
at us, but he's got damn good aim.

211
00:14:44,153 --> 00:14:47,233
I'll pulverize your
legs so you can't move!

212
00:14:47,633 --> 00:14:49,213
And then run you over!

213
00:14:50,133 --> 00:14:52,192
Everyone, run between the boulders!

214
00:14:55,113 --> 00:14:57,393
Stop running away, you coward!

215
00:14:58,113 --> 00:14:58,943
What?

216
00:14:59,026 --> 00:15:00,313
What are you, roaches?

217
