Oh, no!

218
00:15:03,933 --> 00:15:05,590
He's digging his way through!

219
00:15:05,673 --> 00:15:07,350
And we're no match for him in here.

220
00:15:07,433 --> 00:15:08,263
What a freak!

221
00:15:08,393 --> 00:15:11,550
He's acting like some stupid muscle
head who got caught off in traffic?

222
00:15:11,633 --> 00:15:13,470
and flew into a bit of road rage!

223
00:15:13,553 --> 00:15:14,612
Just keep running!

224
00:15:20,493 --> 00:15:21,753
Wait! Come back!

225
00:15:21,913 --> 00:15:22,933
I can't keep up!

226
00:15:25,133 --> 00:15:27,353
Yeah, okay, so I ran away from home!

227
00:15:27,493 --> 00:15:30,375
I'm a good-for-nothing
drifter that nobody loves!

228
00:15:30,853 --> 00:15:32,013
