229
00:15:33,693 --> 00:15:34,613
Good grief.

230
00:15:34,993 --> 00:15:39,530
If you have time to say all that crap,
you can run away, you damn little brat.

231
00:15:39,613 --> 00:15:42,053
I love you so much, Jotaro!

232
00:15:47,453 --> 00:15:48,283
Ha,

233
00:15:48,513 --> 00:15:50,337
ha, ha, ha, go ahead and climb,

234
00:15:50,573 --> 00:15:55,713
there's no path left for you to take,
no way to escape, no way to survive,

235
00:15:56,073 --> 00:15:59,293
and last but certainly
not least, no future,

236
00:15:59,653 --> 00:16:03,330
because this wheel of
fortune is going to grind you

237
00:16:03,413 --> 00:16:07,153
